Group settings are reconciled automatically. Ownership is verified through the
documented read-only `/owner` resource; on a mismatch (e.g. a clean first run
where SharePoint made the deploying user the owner) the script first attempts
the documented CSOM `ProcessQuery` owner assignment and re-verifies. Only if
the correction does not take effect does Phase {{ phase_num['security'] }} stop before list creation
with an instruction to set the required owner in **Site permissions** and
rerun the same generated script.

Groups marked **yes** are read and fully paginated after settings reconciliation
and owner verification. Any existing member aborts Phase {{ phase_num['security'] }} before list creation;
the deployer never removes membership automatically.

